[{"client_msg_id":"033c61e4-0ad7-4833-b69c-1f27eda5c112","type":"message","user":"UP6PA1UBE","text":"`bat` でいけないかと思ったらPR待ちでダメだった\n\u003chttps://github.com/sharkdp/bat/issues/1081\u003e","ts":"1635757810.451200","attachments":[{"color":"36a64f","fallback":"\u003chttps://github.com/sharkdp/bat/issues/1081|#1081 --wrap unpaged\u003e","id":1,"title":"\u003chttps://github.com/sharkdp/bat/issues/1081|#1081 --wrap unpaged\u003e","text":"I love it when `bat` wraps lines in a single page of output. When output needs to be sent to the pager, though, the wrapped lines are actively unhelpful. I'm very used to issuing `-S` to `less` once a log file is open to change the line wrapping live.\n\nI'd like a `--wrap` mode that behaves like `auto` for unpaged output, but `never` when piping to `less`.","fields":[{"title":"Labels","value":"feature-request, good first issue","short":true},{"title":"Comments","value":"8","short":true}],"mrkdwn_in":["text"],"blocks":null,"footer":"\u003chttps://github.com/sharkdp/bat|sharkdp/bat\u003e","footer_icon":"https://slack.github.com/static/img/favicon-neutral.png","ts":1593541342}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"AJm"}]},{"client_msg_id":"985f213e-17d9-47ab-9839-fa1d11d2f7ac","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"lessのオプションになんかありそうな気もするが。","ts":"1635757782.450600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"c76Wl"}]},{"client_msg_id":"27a7daab-9a7c-47c9-9fb9-13de6ce1a4f5","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"lessが極めて惜しい感","ts":"1635757770.450100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"mIR3M"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c9cafe59-232c-442a-8e45-0d2d935800cd","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"うーんありそうでないのね。","ts":"1635757754.449700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_